abstract: >-
  An experimental agentic web interoperability resolver, profile contract and reference
  implementation for discovering and routing the human-readable, machine-readable,
  retrieval, API, tool, agent and trust surfaces exposed by public websites. ARWP
  preserves discovery provenance, reports conflicts, distinguishes static declarations
  from runtime evidence and maintains evidence-backed benchmarks, protocol observations,
  search/agent conformance rules and citation-oriented project surfaces. The preferred
  product class "agentic web interoperability resolver" is project-defined rather than
  claimed as an established industry standard.
